         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nWe still have two Etruscan-Roman symbols to study: the symbol for 500 (D) and the symbol for 1000 (M).\n\nBut we already know the logic behind the symbols we have. So let us apply what we learned before to write even more numbers.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
