                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The New Orders\n\nThe first five values of the hundreds use the symbol for 100 (C) and the symbol for 500 (D), in the same way we wrote the values between 10 (X) and 50 (L).\n\nThe table below shows the tens on top and the hundreds below. Note: this table shows only the values between 100 and 500.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p data-custom=\"hundreds-and-thousands-table-100-500\"></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Table 1: The first five hundreds (100 to 500), compared with the first five tens (10 to 50).*",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "3a606d7e-6c08-4d5c-891c-77f835a7e7db",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "3a606d7e-6c08-4d5c-891c-77f835a7e7db",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Let Us Think!\n\nWe wrote the first five hundreds by changing only the symbols we used for the first five tens: X, XX, XXX, XL and L became C, CC, CCC, CD and D.\n\nCan we continue using the same logic with the remaining groups (600 to 1000)?",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "26f9dfa0-dd4e-4bf3-86bc-bbe61c9a4196",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "26f9dfa0-dd4e-4bf3-86bc-bbe61c9a4196",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "07666919-8290-4aee-a9fd-af148508f754",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=07666919-8290-4aee-a9fd-af148508f754",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
