               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Let Us Continue\n\nThe logic is exactly the same. We are going to continue the table of the hundreds together with the tens, to reinforce our knowledge.\n\nThe table below shows the tens on top and the hundreds below. Note: this table shows only the values between 600 and 1000.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p data-custom=\"hundreds-and-thousands-table-600-1000\"></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Table 2: The last hundreds (600 to 1000), compared with the last tens (60 to 100).*",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
