            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "5fc193f7-7226-4852-82d1-706a44de71ec",
               "text": "The Missing Numbers",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=d603e3a0-cf2a-497d-9fc3-cfed73743515",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Modifying the Logic\n\nFor the thousands, we could keep writing the symbol M — but then we would have to write very long numbers.\n\nLook, for example, at the number 3456: MMMCDLVI.\n\nSo we use another way to represent these numbers: a bar drawn on top of the symbols.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "59328ead-4e55-4289-a28c-7d415157af85",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
