            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "5fc193f7-7226-4852-82d1-706a44de71ec",
               "text": "The Missing Numbers",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=d603e3a0-cf2a-497d-9fc3-cfed73743515",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class, we learned how to represent hundreds and thousands. The logic for the hundreds is exactly the same as for the tens — only the symbols change.\n\nFor the thousands, we could use the same logic too, but the numbers would become very long. So we draw a bar on top of the symbols to keep them short.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
